---
title: MCP Test Server
endpoints:
  - name: MCP Server Alpha
    url: http://localhost:30800/mcp
    note: no auth
  - name: MCP Server Beta
    url: http://localhost:30801/mcp
    note: bearer auth
---
Alpha tools   echo, add, multiply, to_upper
Beta tools    concat, word_count, reverse
Beta token    gravitee-e2e

Health        GET  /health
Admin         POST /admin/tools/hidden_tool/enable

  curl -s http://localhost:30800/mcp \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \
    -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"gck","version":"1.0"}}}'
